+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use argon2id as the password hashing algorithm. It was chosen for its resistance to GPU-based attacks, as a memory-hard function that suits threat models where attackers may have access to specialized hardware. This decision was recorded on 2026-09-23. No parameter values (memory, iterations, parallelism) have been recorded, so none are specified here.
